OL,3,AIsrael's far right find fertile ground
OL,4,Aamong first-time voters
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn the campaign trail ahead of Israel's
OL,7,Fgeneral elections next week, Ben Gvir
OL,8,Fis often surrounded by a jubilant pack
OL,9,Fof fresh-faced young fans, waving huge
OL,10,Fparty flags over the heads of his
OL,11,Fnumerous security guards.
OL,13,FAt the covered market in Ramle - a
OL,14,Fmixed city of Jewish and Arab Israelis
OL,15,F- he told us his message to young
OL,16,Fvoters was to get out and vote.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
